  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 3.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf se friðman fleo oððon feohte ⁊ nelle hine cyðan, gif hine man ofslea, licge ungylde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a man included in the truce flees or fights and fails to make himself known, no compensation shall be paid for him, if he is slain.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si friðman (id est homo pacis) fugiat, uel repugnet et se nolit indicare, si occidatur, iaceat ungilden (id est insolutus).</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
